    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Visual estimation-Women preference at harvest</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Women are encouraged to select three materials at post-harvest stage Three grains for the best clone, two grains for the second most preferred clone, one grain for the third most preferred clone in the mother and baby plots</ns1:definition>
